      <VERS vnumber="13">And a <gr str="520">cubit </gr>on the one <gr str="2088">side</gr>, and a <gr str="520">cubit </gr>on the other side of that which <gr str="5736">remaineth </gr>in the <gr str="753">length </gr>of the <gr str="3407">curtains </gr>of the <gr str="168">tent</gr>, shall <gr str="5628">hang </gr>over the <gr str="6654">sides </gr>of the <gr str="4908">tabernacle </gr>on this side and on that side, to <gr str="3680">cover </gr>it. <DIV>
